## changelog
# Test file derived from GLB-XCI-xcremote-rpi4-7.44.xci
# Test 1: global F6=Setup Alternates disabled
# Test 2: Traffic-mode F6=Traffic next
# Test 3: StatusMessage added to verify the active Traffic mode
